{title: Lantern window}
{subtitle: Original rehearsal example}
# Personal source remark; unchanged in source export.
{start_of_verse}
[D]At the window, [Bm7]lanterns glow,
[Gmaj7/B]little sparks above the [A7]snow.

[*Softly][Em7]Leave a little [A/C#]light for me.
{end_of_verse}
{comment: Hold the final word}
[N.C.]The room falls still.
